post_install(){
cat <<INFO

Headscale-admin was successfully installed. Now you need add configuration to your reverse proxy. Example for nginx:

    location /admin {
        alias /usr/share/webapps/headscale-admin;
        index index.html;
    }

And for using headscale-admin you need create api key in your headscale:

# headscale apikeys create --expiration 90d

INFO
}

